WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.951
The headline result is that DAB outperforms every
baseline on both out-of-distribution tasks.

00:00:05.031 --> 00:00:09.982
Trained on CIFAR-10, it reaches an AUROC of 0.986
and AUPRC of 0.994 against SVHN,

00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:15.014
and an AUROC of 0.922 and AUPRC of 0.915 against
the harder CIFAR-100,

00:00:15.094 --> 00:00:20.045
beating even a five-model deep ensemble.

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:25.076
Crucially,

00:00:25.156 --> 00:00:30.107
it does this in a single forward pass with about
thirty-six and a half million parameters,

00:00:30.188 --> 00:00:35.139
versus the ensemble's roughly one hundred and
eighty-two million,

00:00:35.219 --> 00:00:40.170
while keeping accuracy on par at about ninety-six percent.
